The project must use the following technology stack.

| Layer | Technology |
|---|---|
| Frontend | React.js |
| Build Tool | Vite |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS |
| Backend | Node.js |
| Backend Framework | Express.js |
| Database | MongoDB |
| ODM | Mongoose |
| AI | Google Gemini API |
| Authentication | JWT |
| Password Security | bcrypt |
| API Communication | REST API |
| File Storage | Configurable cloud/object storage |
| Validation | Zod or equivalent |
| Version Control | Git |
| Development | VS Code / Codex |

