# 3. USER ROLES

## 3.1 Guest User

A guest user can:

- Visit the landing page.
- Understand how AI Class Room works.
- View platform features.
- Register or log in.

For the initial MVP, account registration is required before creating and saving investigation cases.

## 3.2 Registered User

A registered user can:

- Access the dashboard.
- Create a new investigation.
- Enter a custom scenario.
- Generate an AI investigation.
- View suspects.
- Access evidence.
- Submit a culprit selection.
- View investigation results.
- View previously created investigations.
- Delete their own investigations.

## 3.3 Administrator

Administrator functionality is not required in the initial MVP.

The system should nevertheless be designed so that an admin role can be introduced later without rewriting the core architecture.

