## 4.2 Authentication

Implement:

- User registration.
- User login.
- Logout.
- Protected routes.
- JWT authentication.
- Password hashing.

### Registration Fields

- Full Name
- Email
- Password
- Confirm Password

### Login Fields

- Email
- Password

### Security Requirements

- Never store plain-text passwords.
- Never expose JWT secrets to the frontend.
- Validate all authentication requests.
- Use secure token handling.
- Apply authentication middleware to protected APIs.

